```console
$ redkiln lint --help
Check a facet registry against a rule and exit by its table

Usage: redkiln lint [OPTIONS] <--facet-stability|--facet-provenance> <FACETS_TOML>

Arguments:
  <FACETS_TOML>  The facet registry to read

Options:
  -C <PATH>                      Act on the repository at this path instead of the working directory
      --facet-stability          Check every declared facet against its stability record at the pinned corpus
      --facet-provenance         Check that every declared facet value has a registered fact behind it
      --stability-record <PATH>  Stability records; absent, the rule runs over an empty map
      --pinned-corpus <PATH>     The pinned corpus results; absent, the location CORPUS_PIN records is used
  -h, --help                     Print help

```
